{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25097","headline":"北原情三首 一 · 刘言史","name":"北原情三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"错莫天色愁，挽歌出重闉。\n谁家白网车，送客入幽尘。\n铭旌下官道，葬舆去辚辚。\n萧条黄蒿中，奠酒花翠新。\n米雪晚霏微，墓成悄无人。\n乌鸢下空地，烟火残荒榛。\n生人更多苦，入户事盈身。\n营营日易深，却到不得频。\n寂寥孤隧头，草绿棠梨春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘言史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}